  "Z_tex": "Z = \\tfrac12\\big(Z_{1,1}+Z_{1,g}+Z_{g,1}+Z_{g,g}\\big),\\quad Z_{1,g} = \\sum_{l\\ \\mathrm{even}}|t_l|^2 - |t_f|^2,\\quad Z_{g,1} = \\sum_{y>0}|\\mathcal{T}_y|^2 + \\mathcal{T}_0\\overline{\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0} + \\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0\\overline{\\mathcal{T}_0}",
  "character_tex": "Parafermion characters (string functions) $\\Phi^l_m$ from $\\chi^{SU(2)_k}_l(\\tau,z) = \\sum_{m\\in\\mathbb{Z}_{2k}}\\Phi^l_m(\\tau)\\,\\Theta_{m,k}(\\tau,z)/\\eta(\\tau)$, fields $(l,m)\\sim(k-l,m+k)$. On the $C$-fixed fields $(l,0)$, $l$ even, the twined characters are $t_l = (-1)^{l/2}\\eta(2\\tau)^{-1}\\sum_{x\\equiv l+1\\ (2K)}\\sin\\frac{\\pi x}{2}\\,q^{x^2/4K}$, $K = k+2$, and $\\Phi^{l,\\pm}_0 = \\frac12(\\Phi^l_0\\pm t_l)$. Twisted characters: $\\mathcal{T}_y = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}}(-1)^n q^{(y+2Kn)^2/16K}$ ($y\\equiv k$ mod 2, $0<y\\le k$), of weight $h = \\frac{k-2+y^2}{16K}$; $\\mathcal{T}^{\\pm}_y$ are its parts with $L_0-h$ in $\\mathbb{Z}$ and $\\mathbb{Z}+\\frac12$. For even $k$ the fixed field $(k/2,\\pm k/2)$ has $t_f = \\eta(2\\tau)/\\eta(\\tau)$, $\\Phi^{k/2,\\pm}_{k/2} = \\frac12(\\Phi^{k/2}_{k/2}\\pm t_f)$, and the $y=0$ twisted characters are $\\mathcal{T}_0 = \\frac12(D_0 + B)$, $\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0 = \\frac12(D_0 - B)$ with $D_0 = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\sum_n(-1)^n q^{Kn^2/4}$ and $B = \\eta(\\tau/2)/\\eta(\\tau)$. Here $k = 8$.",
  "description": "Orbifold of the diagonal $\\mathbb{Z}_{8}$ parafermion theory by the reflection $Cr$ (Dijkgraaf-Vafa-Verlinde-Verlinde 1989). For even $k$ the dihedral reflections form two classes, $C$ and $Cr$; they act alike on the fields $(l,0)$ and differ by a sign on the fixed field $(4,\\pm4)$, where the rotation $r$ is $-1$. Here that sign is $-1$: the untwisted sector pairs $\\Phi^{4,\\pm}_{4}$ with $\\Phi^{4,\\mp}_{4}$, and the twisted sector, from Poisson resummation of $Z_{1,g}$, pairs $\\mathcal{T}_0$ with $\\tilde{\\mathcal{T}}_0$; both sectors are projected to integer spin.",
